WEBVTT

00:00:07.354 --> 00:00:10.231
Three steps. Add USDC.

00:00:11.104 --> 00:00:12.671
Mamoru puts it to work.

00:00:13.354 --> 00:00:15.607
And withdrawal, whenever you want.

00:00:18.221 --> 00:00:19.983
To start, two signatures.

00:00:19.983 --> 00:00:22.378
The first one creates your wallet.

00:00:23.104 --> 00:00:27.089
The second lets Mamoru put it to work, within set rules.

00:00:27.089 --> 00:00:28.655
Only you can withdraw.

00:00:30.971 --> 00:00:33.848
Then add at least 150 USDC on Base:

00:00:33.848 --> 00:00:37.710
the threshold where real APY becomes efficient.

00:00:37.710 --> 00:00:39.764
Mamoru starts on its own.

00:00:42.238 --> 00:00:45.368
Your capital works in three pools:

00:00:45.368 --> 00:00:50.430
50% in stablecoins, 35% in Balanced, and 15% in Growth.

00:00:50.430 --> 00:00:54.296
On average, over 60% stays in stablecoins.

00:00:54.988 --> 00:00:56.980
Profits are collected automatically

00:00:56.980 --> 00:01:00.111
and kept in stablecoins, so your capital keeps working.

00:01:00.988 --> 00:01:02.699
Every move is in your history.

00:01:05.488 --> 00:01:07.392
Withdrawal, whenever you want.

00:01:07.392 --> 00:01:09.613
Choose how much, and where it goes.

00:01:11.121 --> 00:01:12.785
Confirm with your passkey.

00:01:12.785 --> 00:01:14.384
Only you can take it out.
